 "kind": "knowledge",
 "definition": "The base station in a 4G LTE radio network that connects mobile devices to the core network.",
 "description": {
  "text": "The element in LTE mobile networks, short for Evolved Node B, that evolved from the Node B of UMTS. It is the hardware connected to the mobile phone network that communicates wirelessly with handsets, like a base transceiver station in GSM networks.",
